fixing before 54a can be read at all - a blank result in 54a only means the
declaration ate the section header if this file proves the section header
otherwise works.

GENERATE AT NORMAL (200), any player count. ONE RUN.

Keep these two byte-identical apart from the one line. If either is edited, edit
both.
*/
